    "description": "## Ask\n\nFirst Wager Date is confirmed KEEP. Add it to the Log Sign Up screen flow so reps can enter it at logging time, not only after the record is In Progress.\n\n## Target\n\nObject: Sign_Up__c · Field: First Wager Date · Screen flow: Log Sign Up popup\n\n## Done when\n\n* First Wager Date appears in the Log Sign Up popup, optional (not required).\n* Value entered in the popup persists to the Sign-Up record.\n\n## Source\n\nEmily doc comment 2026-08-28: \"Keep and add to popup.\" [Feedback doc](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LOMrG0-0JchyP9wHrV4hMlBqh-gMq8YxknpySd5OJjY/edit)",
