          "id": "10381",
          "body": "**Changes made:**\n\n**\\[Screen\\] - Sign Up - In Progress** (`Screen_Sign_Up_In_Progress`) — now Version 10 (Active), last saved 2026-09-01 1:59 PM UTC.\n\n* Added the First Wager Date field to the screen.\n* Added First Wager Date into the decision logic that sets Status to Complete — record now moves to Complete when First Wager Date is filled in, in combination with the existing condition(s) already driving that decision.\n* Added First Wager Date to the record update (assignment) action so the entered value persists to the Sign-Up record.\n\n**\\[Screen\\] - Sign Up - Complete** (`Screen_Sign_Up_Complete`) — now Version 10 (Active), last saved 2026-09-01 1:53 PM UTC.\n\n* Added the First Wager Date field to the screen.\n* Added First Wager Date to the record update (assignment) action so the entered value persists to the Sign-Up record.\n\n**Testing:** Validated in sandbox. No known risk or downstream impact identified.",
